      "title": "Data Architecture",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "SSG Lab operates on three primary data layers:\n\n**1. Structured JSON** (`data/projects/*.json`) — Canonical project facts: names, team, funding, demo dates, product highlights. Ground truth for the dashboard.\n\n**2. Mimir Knowledge Graph** — Entity relations, sourcing intel, matching results, historical context. Powers cross-project insights and the Matching Agent's confidence scoring.\n\n**3. Paperclip API** — Agent run status, heartbeat data, task activity, governance. Real-time operational data for the Team and Analytics pages."
        }
      ]
    },
